  "id": "athletic-coping-skills-inventory",
  "term": "Athletic Coping Skills Inventory",
  "definition": "The Athletic Coping Skills Inventory is a sport psychology measure used to assess athletes’ psychological regulation skills for handling competitive demands. In this context, it relates to abilities such as focusing attention, coping with adversity, setting goals, and managing pressure.",
